# Site conventions

This is Gervis Bermudez's Jekyll 4.4 blog/portfolio (Arter + Elementor HTML). Production lives at `https://gervisbermudez.github.io/site` with `baseurl: /site`.

- Read `AGENTS.md` before large changes.
- Do not rewrite Elementor/Arter class soup or `public/plugins/`.
- Posts are HTML in `_posts/`, not Markdown.
- New CSS belongs in `public/css/styles.css`.
- Every internal URL and asset must use Liquid `| relative_url`.
- Use `_config.yml` locally; production builds use `_config_prod.yml`.
- Content voice: English, first person. Do not “correct” existing Spanish UI strings.
